\"control\": 73\n    40\t   },\n    41\t   \"outcome\": \"improved\",\n    42\t   \"provisional\": \"improved\",\n    43\t   \"gains\": 3\n    44\t  }\n    45\t },\n    46\t \"verdict\": [\n    47\t  \"pass\",\n    48\t  \"all three pairs improved\"\n    49\t ]\n    50\t}\n    51\toff-window dates -> refused: S-A: date 2026-10-01 is outside the window\n    52\tempty findings -> refused: findings must give every flag as a boolean: ('linked_double_refusal', 'infrastructure_stop\n    53\tan invalid credit class -> refused: pair 2 2026-07-10: gain review 'maybe' is not valid\n    54\ta missing gain review -> refused: pair 2: the gain reviews cover 2 dates, not its 3 gains\n    55\ta flag that disagrees with the summaries -> refused: flag infrastructure_stop is True in the findings but False in the run summaries\n    56\tan unread pair -> refused: S-A: class None is not one of ('definite', 'overlap', 'clear', 'unresolved')\n    57\tgain review rows: 18 | H rows: {'H3': 1521, 'H4': 213, 'H5': 84}\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-dry2/control-1/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-dry2/linked-3/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-dry2/linked-2/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-dry2/control-2/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-dry2/linked-1/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-dry2/control-3/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-mutants2/a-non-reader-bought/linked-1/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-mutants2/stale-upstream-recorded/linked-1/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-mutants2/a-probe-link-answer-missing/linked-1/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-mutants2/control-not-retired/control-1/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-mutants2/swapped-upstreams/linked-2/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-mutants2/a-reader-missing-from-the-allow-list/linked-1/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-stop/ref/linked-1/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-stop/dr/control-1/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-stop/dr/linked-1/summary.json\n/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/scratchpad/paid-stop/linked-1/summary.json\n53:   `preflight-window.log` (old-2's archive and ledger) and `v120-replay-{1,2,3}.log` (the probe archives' link answers).\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
